---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section class="init-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="init-header">
      <div class="eyebrow ctr">What We Do</div>
      <h2 class="st bl">Our Initiatives</h2>
      <p>Two flagship initiatives — with full program details on each initiative page.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="init-grid">
      <a class="init-card" href={`${base}warrior-retreat/`}
        ><img class="ic-logo" src={`${base}assets/cc71eaccc186820e.webp`} alt="Warrior Retreat" />
        <p class="ic-body">
          A four-day fellowship for healing trauma through Post-Traumatic Growth. Fishing, shooting,
          kayaking and art therapy — real healing for real warriors.
        </p>
        <span class="ic-link">Learn More →</span></a
      ><a class="init-card" href={`${base}av-active/`}
        ><img class="ic-logo" src={`${base}assets/f97c933a5da9dbef.webp`} alt="AV Active" />
        <p class="ic-body">
          Too many vets lose themselves searching for purpose after service. AV Active is an app in
          development — a digital hub for communication, encouragement and productive activities
          that keeps vets engaged in a positive way. Sponsors can track and support veterans through
          the transition to civilian life.
        </p>
        <span class="ic-link">Get Involved →</span></a
      >
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
